# Vendored reference data is pinned BY HASH. Git must not touch a byte of it.
#
# 🔴 Found 2026-08-23 by cloning this repo the way a stranger would: on Windows,
# git converted these files LF -> CRLF on checkout, which changed their SHA256,
# which broke `test_schema_files_are_the_ones_we_pinned`. The suite passed in the
# author's working directory and FAILED in a fresh clone -- the exact
# self-consistency-is-not-conformance failure this package exists to talk about,
# in this package.
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion. Do not remove it: the hash pin is
# the only thing standing between "we validate against the official schema" and
# "we validate against a schema we might have altered".
tests/schemas/** -text
tests/vectors/** -text

# Source stays normalised so the repo is sane to work in on any platform.
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
